     fhir:Narrative.div "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"><p class=\"res-header-id\"><b>Generated Narrative: ValueSet swallow-screening-type-vs</b></p><a name=\"swallow-screening-type-vs\"> </a><a name=\"hcswallow-screening-type-vs\"> </a><p>This value set includes codes based on the following rules:</p><ul><li>Include these codes as defined in <a href=\"http://www.snomed.org/\"><code>http://snomed.info/sct</code></a><span title=\"Version is not explicitly stated. No matching Code System found\"> version Not Stated (use latest from terminology server)</span><table class=\"none\"><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><b>Code</b></td><td><b>Display</b></td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"http://snomed.info/id/1289999007\">1289999007</a></td><td>Gugging swallowing screen</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"http://snomed.info/id/717684008\">717684008</a></td><td>Yale Swallow Protocol</td></tr></table></li><li>Include these codes as defined in <a href=\"CodeSystem-dysphagia-scales-temp.html\"><code>https://sefatuncer.github.io/stroke-dysphagia-fhir-ig/CodeSystem/dysphagia-scales-temp</code></a><span title=\"Version is not explicitly stated, which means it is fixed to the version provided in this specification\"> version ?1.2.0</span><table class=\"none\"><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><b>Code</b></td><td><b>Display</b></td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"CodeSystem-dysphagia-scales-temp.html#dysphagia-scales-temp-EAT-10\">EAT-10</a></td><td style=\"color: #cccccc\">Eating Assessment Tool-10 — total score</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"CodeSystem-dysphagia-scales-temp.html#dysphagia-scales-temp-TOR-BSST\">TOR-BSST</a></td><td style=\"color: #cccccc\">Toronto Bedside Swallowing Screening Test — pass/fail</td></tr></table></li></ul></div>"
